            "targetClass": "SIG",
            "policyVersion": "1.1",
            "scope": "app"
          }
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "pqscan/recommend/pk_decrypt",
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "RSA PK_DECRYPT [T2] -> KEM_DEM: RSA public-key decryption / key unwrapping has no drop-in PQC replacement. Redesign as KEM + KDF + AEAD (SP 800-227 Secs. 2.1, 5.2), decapsulation side: decapsulate with the ML-KEM decapsulation key, derive the content key from the shared secret (FIPS 203 Sec. 3.3), and decrypt with an AEAD. The existing decrypt(ciphertext) call shape cannot be preserved."
          },
