          "message": {
            "text": "X25519 KEY_ESTABLISHMENT [T3] -> KEM: X25519 key establishment is deprecated after 2030 and disallowed after 2035 (NIST IR 8547 Table 4) and is exposed to harvest-now-decrypt-later. Redesign around ML-KEM (FIPS 203; ML-KEM-768 recommended by NIST IR 8547) per SP 800-227; a PQ/T hybrid with the existing scheme via an approved combiner (SP 800-227 Sec. 4.6) is an acceptable transitional design. ML-KEM uses encapsulate/decapsulate, not a symmetric exchange(peer) call."
